---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../../consts';
---
<SiteLayout lang="en" title="About" description="About Mi and this journal.">
	<main class="reading-container text-page">
		<span class="eyebrow">About</span>
		<h1>Hello, I'm Mi.</h1>
		<p>Welcome to Mi’s journal. This is where I gather my thoughts and write about reading and everyday life.</p>
		<p>This page is a starting point. Over time, I can add more about my experiences, the topics I care about, and what I hope to share here.</p>
		<p>Want to see what I have written recently? Visit the <a href="/en/blog/">post archive</a>, or find me on <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>
		<p class="note">Edit this page in src/pages/en/about.astro.</p>
	</main>
</SiteLayout>
